<view class="page channel-page">
  <view class="intro"><text class="title">合作店长后台</text><text>下载自己的推广图，查看推荐客户到店与消费核算记录。</text></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}">{{notice}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{!account && !loading}}" class="card"><text>首次使用：输入酒吧管理员单独发给你的账号邀请码。</text><input value="{{token}}" password="true" maxlength="43" bindinput="tokenInput" disabled="{{busy}}"/><button bindtap="accept" disabled="{{busy || !token}}">绑定本人合作账号</button></view>
  <button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy || loading}}">{{loading ? '正在读取…' : '刷新后台'}}</button>
  <block wx:if="{{account}}"><text class="title">{{account.promoter.name}}</text><text wx:if="{{account.contact}}">酒吧对接人：{{account.contact}}</text><view wx:if="{{account.restaurant}}" class="card"><text>已授权的本餐厅汇总</text><view wx:for="{{account.restaurant}}" wx:key="name"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.visitCount}} 组 · 应计 {{item.commissionText}}</text></view></view>
    <view wx:for="{{account.batches}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><text class="title">{{item.rule.title}}</text><text>优惠号码：{{item.offerCode}}</text><text>已领取 {{item.claims}} 次 · 已到店 {{item.arrivals}} 组</text><text>{{item.acceptingClaims ? '有效时间与剩余额度以核验时为准' : '暂停新领取，已发有效券继续按规则使用'}}</text><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="download" disabled="{{busy}}">下载专属推广图</button></view>
    <button wx:if="{{account.nextCursors.batches}}" data-kind="batches" bindtap="loadHistory" disabled="{{busy || loading || historyBusy}}">加载更多推广图</button>
    <text>绑定与到店记录</text><view wx:for="{{account.visits}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><text>客组尾号 {{item.visitNumber}} · {{item.orderCount}} 笔订单</text><text>{{item.arrivedAt ? '员工已确认到店' : '到店待现场确认'}}</text><text>计佣消费 {{item.consumptionText}} · 累计应计佣金 {{item.commissionText}}</text><text>{{item.closedAt ? '客组已结束' : '客组未结束'}}。应计佣金不代表已付款；退款会调整佣金。</text></view>
    <button wx:if="{{account.nextCursors.visits}}" data-kind="visits" bindtap="loadHistory" disabled="{{busy || loading || historyBusy}}">加载更多客组记录</button>
    <text>最近 {{account.finance.limit}} 条佣金核算进度；余额按完整账本计算</text><view wx:for="{{account.finance.positions}}" wx:key="visitId" class="card"><text>应计 {{item.amountText}} · {{item.frozen ? item.reasonText : '按观察期等待结算'}}</text><text>核对时间 {{item.checkedAt}} {{item.stale ? ' · 待同步，请稍后刷新' : ''}}</text></view>
    <view wx:for="{{account.finance.balances}}" wx:key="promoterId" class="card"><text>累计应计 {{item.accruedText}} · 实付净额 {{item.paidText}} · 未付余额 {{item.balanceText}}</text><text>负余额表示已付后发生退款调整，将抵扣后续佣金。</text></view><text>结算单与实际付款</text><view wx:for="{{account.finance.statements}}" wx:key="id" class="card"><text>单号 {{item.id}}</text><text wx:if="{{item.sourceStatementId}}">原单 {{item.sourceStatementId}} 的尾款续结，不新增佣金。</text><button data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="viewStatement" disabled="{{busy}}">查看原消费与退款明细</button><text>本单 {{item.amountText}} · 实付净额 {{item.paidText}}</text><text>{{item.status === 'pending' ? '待确认' : item.status === 'confirmed' ? '已确认待审批' : item.status === 'disputed' ? '争议处理中' : item.status === 'approved' ? '已审批，实际付款以实付净额为准' : '已取消'}}</text><block wx:if="{{account.promoter.canConfirmStatement && (item.status === 'pending' || item.status === 'confirmed')}}"><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-dispute="0" disabled="{{busy || item.status === 'confirmed'}}" bindtap="statementResponse">核对无误，确认本单</button><button data-id="{{item.id}}" data-dispute="1" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="statementResponse">提出争议</button></block></view>
    <button wx:if="{{account.nextCursors.statements}}" data-kind="statements" bindtap="loadHistory" disabled="{{busy || loading || historyBusy}}">加载更多结算单</button>
    <view wx:if="{{statementDetail}}" class="card"><text>当前核对单号 {{statementDetail.statement.id}}</text><text>收款主体 {{statementDetail.statement.accountSubject}} · 账户资料/脱敏标识 {{statementDetail.statement.accountReference}}</text><view wx:for="{{statementDetail.lines}}" wx:key="visitId"><text>客组 {{item.visitId}} · 合格净消费 {{item.basisText}} · 本次佣金差额 {{item.deltaText}}</text><view wx:for="{{item.orders}}" wx:for-item="order" wx:key="orderId"><text>原订单 {{order.orderId}} · 实收 {{order.paidText}} · 成功退款 {{order.refundText}} · 本次计佣基数 {{order.basisText}}</text></view></view></view>
  </block>
</view>
